<title>JAPAN: Japan Servo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Japan Servo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.38		vs	   12.55</p>
<p> Operating	 prft 17 million	  vs   loss 273    million</p>
